    <briefdescription>
<para>Re-ranks retrieved documents using a domain-specific LoRA scorer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Overview</title><para>Wraps an <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_i_lo_r_a_scorer" kindref="compound">ILoRAScorer</ref></computeroutput> and uses it to compute a domain relevance signal for the top-K retrieved documents. The original retrieval score is fused with the LoRA score via a configurable weight.</para>
</simplesect>
Production target: MRR@10 ≥ +5% vs pure RRF baseline (Q2 2027).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Injection</title><para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_heuristic_lo_r_a_scorer" kindref="compound">HeuristicLoRAScorer</ref></computeroutput> is the default baseline (Jaccard token overlap). Inject a real <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_i_lo_r_a_scorer" kindref="compound">ILoRAScorer</ref></computeroutput> via the constructor or <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_lo_r_a_enhanced_retriever_1a8a7fa4949fcabfa39923e8c7f1ff3b88" kindref="member">setScorer()</ref></computeroutput> to activate model-inferred scoring backed by <computeroutput>MultiLoRAManager</computeroutput>.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Thread safety</title><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_lo_r_a_enhanced_retriever_1a6a92b2701d9df6e77168c6fbcf3a3fb1" kindref="member">rerank()</ref></computeroutput> is const and safe to call concurrently once constructed.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Usage example</title><para><programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="normal">LoRARetrieverConfig<sp/>cfg;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.domain<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;legal&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.lora_weight<sp/>=<sp/>0.35;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cfg.top_k_rerank<sp/>=<sp/>20;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>scorer<sp/>=<sp/>std::make_shared&lt;HeuristicLoRAScorer&gt;(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;legal&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_lo_r_a_enhanced_retriever_1aba8566e56ae33f3492ffe97eb5356aa1" kindref="member">LoRAEnhancedRetriever</ref><sp/>retriever(scorer,<sp/>cfg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>results<sp/>=<sp/>retriever.rerank(query,<sp/>initial_docs);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
